{"sourceUrl":"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/tzgg/97c7ce5480334aa99741280f808cb740.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:59.586768+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/tzgg/97c7ce5480334aa99741280f808cb740.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>                    公告及下载\n</h3>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/xyxw/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学院新闻</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/tzgg/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">通知公告</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/cywj2/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">文件下载</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/ggjxz/bslc/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">办事流程</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>通知公告</h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h5></h5>\n<h3>人工智能学院2027年预推免系统二次报名通知</h3>\n<h6></h6>\n</div>\n<i>\n      时间：2026-09-11  浏览：</i>\n</div>\n<h1><br/></h1>\n<p><span>各位考生：</span></p>\n<p><span>我院</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试研究生首轮报名及材料审核工作已完成。因本直博报名人数不足，现开放推免系统二次报名，开展补录工作。</span></p>\n<p><span>本次二次报名仅针对本直博中</span><span>081200</span><span>计算机科学与技术专业下设</span><span>01</span><span>、</span><span>03</span><span>、</span><span>04</span><span>、</span><span>05</span><span>方向；</span><span>140500智能科学与技术专业下设01、02、03方向，报名其他专业及方向无效。报名流程详见《北京师范大学2027年</span><span>推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生招生录取工作办法》。</span></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ai.bnu.edu.cn/images/2026-09/964a354cae9c4f1fafadf0b9ed6ed39c.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>请考生在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span><span>18:00</span><span>前</span><span>登录北京师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免申请系统进行申请（</span><span>https://yzh.bnu.edu.cn/www/tm/xs/login</span><span>），无需寄送纸质版材料，申请材料电子版按照要求上传系统，（超大申请材料附件可以同时发送</span><span>ai@bnu.edu.cn</span><span>，邮件名称：报考专业</span><span>+</span><span>直博</span><span>/</span><span>卓越博士</span><span>+</span><span>姓名）。系统内材料收到情况</span><span>最晚于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span><span>20:00</span><span>进行状态更新，推免复试时间</span><span>暂定</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日，具体安排后续通知</span><span>，请考生一定提前合理安排行程、购买车票。其他推免信息公告、复试安排等，将在北京师范大学推免申请系统中公布，请申请人随时登陆系统，了解相关信息。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span>人工智能学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<div><br/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"2776192e080a8bd22e8e25ef168c0fa20fbda501565f90c054e6069cd042be18","textLength":546,"sourceSha256":"a126e1d3fc6ed4fb0033823bed9ccc608a5a682f63ef1207ef5b32424dda597b","selector":"article-like:content-list","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6787862a59fab0beef17","title":"2026年北京师范大学人工智能学院2027年预推免系统二次报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:59.586768+00:00"}
